&lt;p&gt;A magnitude 5.9 earthquake jolted Balochistan’s Khuzdar district on Saturday, according to the Pakistan Meteorological Department (PMD).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The quake occurred at 10:07am at a depth of 25 kilometres, the PMD said in a post on X.&lt;/p&gt;
